WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:24.000
Semifinals of Darkness
Jonouchi vs Marik

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.170
This didn't go as planned, but it's fine.

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:37.800
You'll pay for angering me, Jonouchi.

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:40.420
It's finally time.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:43.310
I promise to beat Marik and save you.

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.380
Just wait, Mai!

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:50.740
This is fine.

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.860
My duel of destiny against Yugi.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.330
I'm the one who'll win.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:00.560
Everything will now be settled.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.170
They're gone.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.460
Guys!  This way!

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.820
We're going up too!

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.240
Wait up!

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:19.740
Shouldn't we tell Shizuka that Jonouchi's semifinal match is about to start?

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:20.760
You're right.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.590
Fine.  I'll go.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:23.620
Wait!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:27.090
I'll call her with this.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:31.100
No.  I'll stay and look after Mai.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:35.100
I know my brother will win.

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:37.320
Yes.  Thank you.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.930
Brother...

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.630
This is the final duel arena?

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:11.060
Kinda bland.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.370
Don't worry.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.760
I'll provide some interesting scenery.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.630
Something that's not of this world.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:21.500
Look forward to it, Jonouchi!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:38.900
During the battle royal, Jonouchi defeated himself so that he could duel Marik.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:43.310
He wants to duel Marik that badly because...

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.130
Yugi!

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.480
Jonouchi.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:48.640
Win the first duel of the semifinals.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:51.140
Yeah!  Don't worry!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:56.650
I'll take Marik's God Card and fulfill our promise in the finals, Yugi!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:01.220
You're not good enough to touch a God.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:02.650
Say what, Kaiba!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:06.770
I declare that Marik will instantly defeat you.

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:10.140
You punk!  Such a loudmouth!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.370
I've kept winning in Battle City to get here!

00:04:13.370 --> 00:04:14.920
I won't lose so easily!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:19.650
You don't know the true power of Marik's God Card.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:23.170
The Winged Dragon of Ra's terrifying effects.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:25.910
I-It's that powerful?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.910
Kaiba, you know what Ra's effects are?

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.920
Yeah.  I deciphered most of it.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:40.660
He deciphered the hieroglyphic card text?

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:46.920
Can you read the text?

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:52.460
The text explains how to awaken Ra's true power.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:54.670
Ra's true power?

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:59.110
Yes.  Ra's terrifying effects.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.550
This is one of Ra's effects.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:15.640
Since I chanted the text correctly, God will serve me.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:22.370
Arise for my victory, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:26.400
This is The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:33.040
This is...

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.000
Big brother?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:34.960
Impossible...

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:37.370
I can understand the text.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:43.020
It reveals The Winged Dragon of Ra's terrifying effects!

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:46.180
How can you read it?

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:51.340
Kaiba must have a connection to the Millennium Items.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:59.140
Yugi, even you can't win against Marik's Ra Deck.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.370
Even Yugi can't win?

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:09.380
Ra's effects are greater than my Obelisk or your Slifer.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:20.720
I need to see Marik duel again to understand his strategies perfectly.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:25.600
Jonouchi, you're perfect to bait Marik.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.860
Bait?

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:32.370
Yugi, if you dueled Marik in the semifinals...

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.460
...there's a chance Marik will get Slifer.

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:41.880
If that happened, I would've had to face two God Cards in the finals.

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.110
Are you still yapping?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:48.720
Kaiba, there's one flaw in your plan.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:54.790
Your opponent in the semifinals is me.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:04.100
I'm looking forward to our duel of destiny, Yugi.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.100
That punk!

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:12.700
Big brother!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.860
Here they are!

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:15.350
Yugi!  Jonouchi!

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.840
Jonouchi, what's with the weird face?

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.320
Did something happen?

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.350
It's nothing!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.850
What's up with him?

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:24.590
Jonouchi...

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:29.700
Damn that Kaiba!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:34.660
He's trying to scare me before my duel.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:35.970
But it won't work.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.970
The God's power is strong.

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:45.860
But my deck contains the cherished cards of the duelists I faced in Battle City.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:48.710
And most of all...

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:55.520
I can't save Mai unless I beat Marik.

00:07:55.940 --> 00:08:01.920
If I give up on Mai, I can never have a true duel against Yugi.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:05.430
Watch!  I promise to win!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.720
We'll now begin the Battle City semfinals.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.670
Match #1!  Marik Ishtar!

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.140
His opponent, Katsuya Jonouchi!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.040
Yeah!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.060
Win, Jonouchi!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.780
Good luck, Jonouchi!

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.510
Don't lose!

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:33.690
There's nothing more I can do except watch.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.600
Start the duel!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:42.290
I go first!  I draw!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:45.500
I summon Gil Garth in attack position!

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:51.010
I set a card and end my turn.

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.000
Here I go!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.780
My turn!  I draw!

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:59.300
Marik's Gil Garth has 1800 attack points.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:02.080
None of my monsters can destroy it.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.600
I set a card.

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:09.450
I summon Alligator's Sword in defense position!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:15.820
I'll never lose to you!

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:17.270
I end my tur-

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:23.270
My other self!  This is...

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:25.010
Not again!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.240
Oh no!

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:27.740
It's a Shadow Game.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.100
Big brother!

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:40.220
The Shadow Game begins, Jonouchi.

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.220
Shadow Game?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.920
You want to meet her, right?

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:47.280
I'll let you meet her.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:50.600
In a dark world of death when you lose.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.700
What?  What do you mean?

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:56.110
I told you she's not merely sleeping.

00:09:56.440 --> 00:10:02.980
Even as we speak, the darkness is slowly overtaking her spirit.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.820
I can hear her.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:17.310
Her screams of agony sound very pleasant.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.300
How dare you!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:44.390
The Shadow Game has started.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:49.080
You're creating new victims, Marik?

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.730
How dare you!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:11:00.170
He knows that if he loses, he'll end up the same as Mai.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.730
But he's still going to duel?

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.740
That's crazy!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.720
Jonouchi expected this.

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:07.080
But he still wanted to beat Marik.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:08.400
Anzu?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:10.080
I'm sorry, Yugi.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:12.080
Jonouchi told me not to tell you.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:15.080
Anzu, don't tell Yugi.

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.520
Why not?

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:24.860
We promised that we'd fight fair and square as true duelists.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.460
True duelists?

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:30.670
I don't know if I qualify yet.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:32.970
But I know this:

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:37.100
If I can't save Mai, I'm not a true duelist.

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:47.050
In order to fulfill my promise with Yugi, I must defeat Marik and save Mai.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:52.150
Jonouchi is fighting Marik to save Mai with his own hands.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:53.670
Jonouchi...

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.860
My other self, stop Jonouchi!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:00.660
If he loses the duel, he'll end up the same as Mai and Bakura!

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:03.400
Partner, I can't do that.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:11.110
Jonouchi wanted this duel, knowing that Marik would start a Shadow Game.

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:15.810
He's betting on himself as a duelist, so no one can stop this duel.

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:16.810
But!

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:19.810
My other self, believe in Jonouchi!

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:25.910
This is my fight.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.220
I have to defeat Marik and save Mai.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.990
So wait for me, Yugi!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:37.500
I accept this Shadow Game!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.370
And I'll beat you!

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:43.080
You think you can beat me?

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:48.060
Interesting.  Let's see how long you can keep your spirits up.

00:12:48.060 --> 00:12:50.110
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:54.570
Once you step into a Shadow Game, you can't run away.

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:59.020
Like with that girl, no one can help you.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:05.130
I'll keep you entertained until your moment of defeat and death.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.130
Stop talking and go!

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:14.130
Before that, I'll tell you what punishment awaits the loser of this duel.

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:17.950
The loser will sink deep into the dark world.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:25.150
His spirit and body will slowly fall into a world of death and eternal pain.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.150
Getting excited?

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.000
I envy you, Jonouchi.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.250
You get to experience it soon.

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.740
He's so creepy.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:39.790
He's trying to psych him out.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.500
Ignore him, Jonouchi!

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:44.230
You don't scare me!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:47.730
You won't be saying that soon.  Look!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:51.740
What?

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:55.480
Since when was I connected to my monster?

00:13:55.720 --> 00:14:03.580
In this ultimate game, when a monster takes damage, the duelist gets to feel its pain and fear.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:06.590
Enjoy it.

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:11.320
Entertain me with your screams, just like that girl did.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.060
You punk!

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:15.560
The real game now begins!

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:19.800
I summon Drillago in attack position!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.400
Go!  Drillago!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.770
Alligator's Sword is destroyed!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.850
Brother...

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.220
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:46.870
When a monster takes damage, the player also feels it.

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:48.160
Jonouchi...

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:54.170
What?  I felt a lot of pain when my monster was destroyed.

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:59.140
Pain is real in this ultimate game.

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:02.300
But damage from a direct attack is much worse!

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:04.020
Go, Gil Garth!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.200
Attack Jonouchi directly!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:09.020
Jonouchi!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:10.800
Not gonna happen!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.320
I flip over my set card!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.900
Scapegoat!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:19.460
What?

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:24.830
They're not monster cards, so I don't take damage when they're destroyed.

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:26.200
Nicely done!

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.260
So you're actually using your brain.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:31.440
I end my turn.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.940
My turn.  I draw!

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:35.480
Nice!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.820
I summon Panther Warrior in attack position!

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:42.700
Here I go!

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:46.620
I tribute one Scapegoat and attack Gil Garth!

00:15:58.260 --> 00:15:59.800
That's payback!

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:03.380
You're playing well.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:05.810
Or else, this game would be boring.

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:08.420
Stop acting tough!

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:09.540
I end my turn!

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:12.050
Jonouchi is playing tough.

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.280
I hope so.

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.700
My turn.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:17.980
I draw.

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:21.490
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.730
Tribute Burial!

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:24.990
What?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:29.050
Instead of tributing monsters on the field...

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:35.740
...I can summon high Level monsters by banishing monsters from our graveyards.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:47.560
I tribute my Gil Garth and your Alligator's Sword to summon Helpoemer!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:53.920
The tributed monsters can't be used in this duel again.

00:16:55.060 --> 00:16:58.020
Helpoemer has 2000 attack points.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:00.510
It's as strong as Panther Warrior.

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:02.930
So he's going to attack my Scapegoat!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.670
I set a card and end my turn.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:08.400
What?

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.580
Jonouchi, be careful.

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:12.400
Marik is up to something!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:17.410
My turn!  I draw!

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:19.480
Jinzo.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.940
This can destroy Helpoemer.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:28.460
But he could've attacked Scapegoat last turn, but he didn't.

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:31.000
Does he want me to attack?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:35.030
I don't know what Helpoemer's effects are.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.730
If I lose Jinzo, I'll be in big trouble.

00:17:38.940 --> 00:17:41.030
I'll see what he does.

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:43.100
I play this!

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:47.240
I summon Rocket Warrior in attack position!

00:17:48.350 --> 00:17:49.570
I caught you!

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:52.240
I activate the trap, Hidden Soldiers!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:58.850
This trap activates when you summon a monster.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:03.130
I can Special Summon a Level 4-or-lower monster from my hand.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.060
I summon Plasma Eel!

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:07.060
What?

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:09.750
I activate its effect!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.630
Go, Plasma Eel!

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:14.310
Equip on Panther Warrior!

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:26.680
At the end of your turn, Plasma Eel lowers the equipped monster's attack points by 500.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:29.820
But it can do something more fun.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:34.050
Jonouchi, feel the pain of hell.

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:41.560
Jonouchi!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:44.800
It's the same pain that the girl felt!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.930
Mai!

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:51.300
No way!  This is Solid Vision, but I can't move!

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:54.080
I told you this was a Shadow Game.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:58.220
All illusions become real.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.380
Even the pain you're feeling.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:02.850
Attack her directly!

00:19:07.380 --> 00:19:11.760
Mai, you endured all this pain.

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:18.130
This hurts so much, but you fought as a duelist to the end.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.760
Just wait, Mai...

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:23.500
I'll pay him back for you!

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:29.010
No way!  You shouldn't be able to stand the pain!

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.360
I'll never forgive you!

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:34.250
Rocket Warrior's effect activates!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.740
Here I go, Marik!

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:42.070
Attack Helpoemer!

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:52.960
Nice!  Counterattack, Jonouchi!

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:59.300
Next, I tribute Scapegoat so that Panther Warrior can attack!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.170
Pursuing Sword Attack!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.930
Mai's emotions are in this strike!

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:09.650
Helpoemer is destroyed!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:12.880
How's that?

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.780
It feels good.

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:22.760
The duel is proceeding as planned.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:24.260
What?

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:31.500
I wanted you to destroy Helpoemer so that I could activate its effect.

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.240
Effect?

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:38.910
When Helpoemer is destroyed in attack position, its effect activates!

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.080
What?

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.310
It's in my Duel Disk's graveyard?

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:46.100
Can't you hear its song?

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:47.820
What's going to happen?

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:52.840
What's this creepy song?

00:20:54.340 --> 00:20:55.190
What?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:58.860
That arm isn't there to spook you.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.570
It's Helpoemer's terrifying effect!

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:04.910
That was...

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:06.700
My hand!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.820
Yes.  At the end of the Battle Phase every turn...

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:16.210
...a random card in your hand goes to the graveyard.

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.800
Destroy a card in his hand every turn!

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:21.220
So this is Marik's terrifying strategy!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:24.220
My Jinzo went to the graveyard.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:25.220
No way...

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:30.280
Jonouchi, you'll sink further into my tactics.

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:33.730
And fall into the darkness.

00:21:43.970 --> 00:21:49.710
In Marik's Shadow Game, Plasma Eel equips on Panther Warrior...

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:52.740
...and deals Jonouchi pain every turn!

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:55.940
Jonouchi keeps dueling, enduring the pain.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:00.880
But Marik's combo attack takes away his cards and life points every turn.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:03.620
At this rate, it's a one-sided defeat!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:06.710
Jonouchi, can't you turn this around?

00:22:06.710 --> 00:22:09.740
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Helpoemer

00:22:09.740 --> 00:22:11.220
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:22.150
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:31.100
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:36.070
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.070 --> 00:22:40.040
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:48.010
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:51.580
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:56.350
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:56.350 --> 00:23:06.460
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:14.070
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:23.040
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:31.020
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:40.860
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
